{'symbol': 'MRK', 'date': '2023-06-22 16:30:00', 'title': 'IRBM EXTENDS PEPTIDE THERAPEUTICS COLLABORATION WITH MERCK & CO. INC., RAHWAY NJ USA', 'text': 'ROME, JUNE 22, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- IRBM, AN INNOVATIVE CONTRACT RESEARCH ORGANIZATION, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED A NEW AGREEMENT WITH MERCK & CO. INC., RAHWAY NJ USA, KNOWN AS MSD OUTSIDE THE USA AND CANADA, TO CONTINUE THEIR COLLABORATION IN THE PEPTIDE THERAPEUTICS AREA.'}